<p>KyotoCreative (“we”, “us”, or “our”) operates the website kyotocreative.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website or contact us.</p>
<p>By using our website, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>
<h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
<p>We only collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us through our contact form. This may include:</p>
<ul>
<li>Name</li>
<li>Email address</li>
<li>Phone number</li>
<li>Project enquiry details</li>
</ul>
<p>We also collect limited technical information through Google Analytics, such as:</p>
<ul>
<li>IP address</li>
<li>Browser type</li>
<li>Device information</li>
<li>Pages visited and time spent on the website</li>
</ul>
<p>This analytics data is used only to understand how visitors use our website and to improve its performance.</p>
<h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
<p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Respond to your enquiries</li>
<li>Understand your project requirements</li>
<li>Communicate with you about potential work</li>
<li>Improve our website and services</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not use your information for any other purpose.</p>
<h3>3. Sharing of Information</h3>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
<p>We only share information when necessary:</p>
<ul>
<li>With service providers who help us operate the website (such as Google Analytics), under strict data protection terms</li>
<li>If required by law or legal process</li>
</ul>
<h3>4. Google Analytics</h3>
<p>We use Google Analytics to collect anonymised information about website traffic and usage. Google Analytics uses cookies and similar technologies. You can learn more about how Google uses data here:<br />
<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></p>
<p>You can also opt out of Google Analytics by installing the Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on.</p>
<h3>5. Cookies</h3>
<p>Our website uses cookies primarily for Google Analytics. These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with the site. You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings.</p>
<h3>6. Data Retention</h3>
<p>We keep personal information only for as long as necessary to respond to your enquiry and for reasonable business records. Analytics data is retained according to Google Analytics settings.</p>
<h3>7. Data Security</h3>
<p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect the personal information we collect. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p>
<h3>8. Your Rights</h3>
<p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</li>
<li>Request correction or deletion of your information</li>
<li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
</ul>
<p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:business@kyotocreative.com">business@kyotocreative.com</a>.</p>
<h3>9. Children’s Privacy</h3>
<p>Our website is not directed at children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
<h3>10. International Visitors</h3>
<p>Our website is operated from India. If you are accessing the site from outside India, please be aware that your information may be transferred to and processed in India.</p>
<h3>11. Changes to This Policy</h3>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
<h3>12. Contact Us</h3>
<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us at:<br />
Email: <a href="mailto:business@kyotocreative.com">business@kyotocreative.com</a><br />
Website: <a href="https://kyotocreative.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://kyotocreative.com</a></p>
he day you use our website. We advise you to print a copy for your records.</li>
<li>If you have any question regarding our privacy policy, please contact us.</li>
</ol>
